Hi Robin,

There is a function in ctmmweb that will make a grid plot. Also, you can just fiddle with par(mfrow) to make a grid plot as well.

Inside the variogram objects is just a data.frame, which you can plot in any package, but the ctmm::plot method is also calculating CIs, choosing aesthetic units (days and km^2 in your plot), and if the plotting area becomes small then it will start abbreviating the axis labels to save space, etc..

Best,
Chris

